#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:65 imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:410
#: imageplugin_noisereduction.cpp:62
msgid "Noise Reduction"
msgstr "បន្ថយ​ភាព​មិន​ច្បាស់"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:67
msgid "A noise reduction image filter plugin for digiKam."
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​តម្រង​រូបភាព​កាត់បន្ថយ​ការ​រំខាន​សម្រាប់ digiKam ។"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:73
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "​អ្នក​និពន្ធ និង អ្នក​ថែទាំ"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:76
msgid "Noise Reduction algorithm. Developer"
msgstr "ក្បួន​ដោះស្រាយ​កាត់​បន្ថយ​ការ​រំខាន ។ អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:87
msgid "Details"
msgstr "សេចក្ដី​លម្អិត"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:89
msgid "Radius:"
msgstr "​កាំ ៖"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:94
msgid ""
"<p><b>Radius</b>: this control selects the gliding window size used for the "
"filter. Larger values do not increase the amount of time needed to filter each "
"pixel in the image but can cause blurring. This window moves across the image, "
"and the color in it is smoothed to remove imperfections. In any case it must be "
"about the same size as noise granularity or somewhat more. If it is set higher "
"than necessary, then it can cause unwanted blur."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>កាំ</b> ៖ វត្ថុបញ្ជា​នេះ​ជ្រើស​ទំហំ​បង្អួចមិ​ន​ស៊ី​ជម្រៅ "
"បាន​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​តម្រង ។ "
"តម្លៃ​ធំជាង​មិន​បង្កើន​ពេលវេលា​សរុប​ដែល​ចាំបាច់​ដើម្បី​ត្រង​ភីកសែល​នីមួយៗនៅ​ក្នុ"
"ង​រូបភាព​ ប៉ុន្តែ​អាច​បណ្ដាល​ឲ្យ​មាន​ភាព​មិន​ច្បាស់ ។ "
"បង្អួច​នេះ​ផ្លាស់ទី​កាត់​រូបភាព​ និង​ពណ៌​​ដែល​វា​បាន​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យរាប់ស្មើ "
"ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទីភាព​មិន​ពេញ​លក្ខណៈ​ចេញ ។ "
"នៅ​ក្នុងករណីមួយ​ចំនួន​វា​មាន​ទំហំ​ដូច​គ្នា​ ជាការ​រំខាន​គ្រាប់ៗ "
"ឬ​ជា​អ្វី​ផ្សេងៗ ។ ប្រសិន​បើ​ វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​កំណត់​ខ្ពស់​ជាង​អ្វី​ដែល​ចាំបាច់ "
"បន្ទាប់​មក​វា​បណ្ដាល​ឲ្យ​មាន​ពណ៌​ព្រាលៗ​ដែល​មិន​ចង់​បាន ។"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:108
msgid "Threshold:"
msgstr "កម្រិត​ពន្លឺ ៖"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:113
msgid ""
"<p><b>Threshold</b>: use the slider for coarse adjustment, and the spin control "
"for fine adjustment. This controls edge detection sensitivity. This value "
"should be set so that edges and details are clearly visible and noise is "
"smoothed out. Adjustment must be made carefully, because the gap between "
"\"noisy\", \"smooth\", and \"blur\" is very small. Adjust it as carefully as "
"you would adjust the focus of a camera."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:126
msgid "Texture:"
msgstr "​វាយនភាព ៖"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:131
msgid ""
"<p><b>Texture</b>: this control set the texture accuracy. This value can be "
"used, to get more or less texture accuracy. When decreased, then noise and "
"texture are blurred out, when increased then texture is amplified, but also "
"noise will increase. It has almost no effect to image edges."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:141
msgid "Sharpness:"
msgstr "ភាព​ច្បាស់ ៖"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:146
msgid ""
"<p><b>Sharpness</b>: This value improves the frequency response for the filter. "
"When it is too strong then not all noise can be removed, or spike noise may "
"appear. Set it near to maximum, if you want to remove very weak noise or "
"JPEG-artifacts, without loosing detail."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:157
msgid "Edge Lookahead:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:162
msgid ""
"<p><b>Edge</b>: This value defines the pixel distance in which the filter looks "
"ahead for Edges. When this value is increased, then spikenoise is erased. You "
"can eventually readjust filter <b>Edge</b>, when you changed this setting. When "
"this value is to high, then the adaptive filter cannot longer accurately track "
"image details, and noise can reappear or blur can occur."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:174
msgid "Erosion:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:179
msgid ""
"<p><b>Erosion</b>: Use this to increase edge noise erosion and spike noise "
"erosion. (noise is removed by erosion)"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:192
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:194
msgid "Luminance:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:199
msgid ""
"<p><b>Luminance</b>: this control set the luminance tolerance of image. It's "
"recommended to use only <b>Color</b> or <b>Luminance</b> "
"tolerance settings to make an image correction, not the both at the same time. "
"This settings don't influence the main smoothing process controled by <b>"
"Details</b> settings."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:209
msgid "Color:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:214
msgid ""
"<p><b>Color</b>: this control set the color tolerance of image. It's "
"recommended to use only <b>Color</b> or <b>Luminance</b> "
"tolerance settings to make an image correction, not the both at the same time. "
"This settings don't influence the main smoothing process controled by <b>"
"Details</b> settings."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:224
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:229
msgid ""
"<p><b>Gamma</b>: this control set the gamma tolerance of image. This value can "
"be used to increase the tolerance values for darker areas (which commonly are "
"more noisy). This results in more blur for shadow areas."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:238
msgid "Damping:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<p><b>Damping</b>: this control set the phase jitter damping adjustement. This "
"value defines how fast the adaptive filter-radius reacts to luminance "
"variations. If increased, then edges appear smoother, if too high, then blur "
"may occur. If at minimum then noise and phase jitter at edges can occur. It can "
"supress spike noise when increased and this is the preferred method to remove "
"it."
msgstr ""

